26-04-24</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        v2.1.114–v2.1.119 released with /ultrareview research preview (cloud-based multi-agent code review), automatic session recaps, custom color themes, redesigned web experience, vim visual mode, native macOS/Linux builds with embedded bfs/ugrep, and /usage command.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor SDK Public Beta</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">FEATURE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-29</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        SDK launched in public beta, allowing developers to build programmatic agents using TypeScript. Uses the same runtime, harness, and models as Cursor, with support for local or cloud execution.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor 3.2: Multi-tasking & Worktrees</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">FEATURE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-24</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added /multitask for parallel async sub-agents, improved worktrees experience for background isolated tasks, and multi-root workspaces for cross-repository modifications without re-targeting.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor 3.1: Canvas Feature</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">FEATURE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-15</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Interactive canvas feature for visual dashboards and custom interfaces with tables, boxes, diagrams, charts, plus diff views and todo lists. Canvases persist in the agent window sidebar.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/cursor-3\">Cursor 3.0 Major Release</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">RELEASE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-02</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Launched as unified workspace for building software with agents. Features multi-repository layout, seamless handoff between local and cloud agents, centralized agent management, parallel execution support.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-30-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-april-update/\">GitHub Copilot: VS Agentic Workflows</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">FEATURE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-30</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        April 2026 Visual Studio update centers on agentic workflows with cloud agent sessions that launch directly from the IDE, plus enhanced custom agents capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-27-github-copilot-code-review-will-start-consuming-github-actions-minutes-on-june-1-2026/\">Copilot Code Review Billing Changes</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type announcement\">ANNOUNCEMENT</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-27</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Starting June 1, 2026, Copilot code review will consume GitHub Actions minutes. All Copilot usage including code reviews will be billed as AI usage.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/blog/windsurf-2-0\">Windsurf 2.0 with Agent Command Center</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">RELEASE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-01</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Major update introducing Agent Command Center showing all agents in unified Kanban-style view, Devin integration as built-in autonomous cloud agent, and new Spaces feature for shared context management.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\">Windsurf: Claude Opus 4.7 Available</a>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">FEATURE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-04-15</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Opus 4.7 model made available in Windsurf IDE as part of April 2026 updates.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40611998\">Agents need control flow, not more prompts</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">183 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by bsuh | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Growing consensus about limitations of prompt-based approaches and need for structured agent architectures.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">control flow</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">architecture</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40612145\">Natural Language Autoencoders</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">91 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Anthropic | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Converting Claude's internal thoughts into text for better AI reasoning interpretability.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">interpretability</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40612034\">AlphaEvolve: Gemini-powered coding agent</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">205 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Google DeepMind | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Coding agent that scales impact across multiple fields, demonstrating domain-specific AI coding trend.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Gemini</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">multi-domain</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40612078\">DeepSeek 4 Flash for Metal</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">185 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by antirez | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Efficient local running of DeepSeek models on Apple Silicon for privacy and performance.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Metal</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">local</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40612251\">Principles for agent-native CLIs</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">29 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by trevin | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Designing CLI tools with agent interaction in mind, not just human interaction.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">CLI design</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agent-native</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40611827\">AI Slop Is Killing Online Communities</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-hn\">HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"points\">172 points</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by rmoff | 2026-05-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Impact of AI-generated low-quality content on online communities and software development.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI impact</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ethics</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05191\">LongSeeker: Elastic Context Orchestration</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Managing and optimizing context windows for agents performing extended search tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">context</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">search agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05138\">Executable World Models for ARC-AGI-3</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        How AI agents can build and execute world models to solve complex reasoning tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ARC-AGI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">world models</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05170\">Design Conductor 2.0: Agent Builds Hardware in 80 Hours</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agent built complete TurboQuant inference accelerator in just 80 hours.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">hardware design</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.04808\">DecodingTrust-Agent Platform (DTap)</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comprehensive 279-page platform for red-teaming AI agents, addressing safety concerns.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI safety</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">red-teaming</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/vibe-coding-and-agentic-engineering/\">Vibe coding and agentic engineering</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-blog\">Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Simon Willison | 2026-05-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Line between AI coding without understanding and responsible AI-assisted development is blurring.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">practices</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/code-w-claude-2026/\">Code w/ Claude 2026 Live Blog</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-blog\">Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Simon Willison | 2026-05-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Managed Agent features, multi-agent orchestration, Routines, CI auto-fix for PRs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">multi-agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.04050\">LCM: Lossless Context Management</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Efficient context management and compression without losing information.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">context</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">compression</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.04956\">KernelBench-X: LLM GPU Kernels Benchmark</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Benchmark for evaluating GPU kernels generated by LLMs for performance-critical code.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">benchmarking</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#about\">About</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">Archi