ingTrust-Agent Platform (DTap)</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-arxiv\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comprehensive 279-page platform for red-teaming AI agents, addressing safety concerns.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI safety</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">red-teaming</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/vibe-coding-and-agentic-engineering/\">Vibe coding and agentic engineering</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-blog\">Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Simon Willison | 2026-05-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Line between AI coding without understanding and responsible AI-assisted development is blurring.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">practices</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/code-w-claude-2026/\">Code w/ Claude 2026 Live Blog</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge source-blog\">Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">by Simon Willison | 2026-05-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Managed Agent features, multi-agent 